WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.080
To the untrained eye, SCP-2317 seems to be no&nbsp;
more than an old, wooden door. But those in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:11.200
the know are more than aware that we have every&nbsp;
reason to fear this gateway to another world.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.760
Specifically, the door opens to a desert-like&nbsp;
reality where a being known colloquially as The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:21.520
Devourer of Worlds resides. When I say “resides”&nbsp;
I mean - it’s where he’s being held and bound by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.880
ancient chains - for now. The Foundation is&nbsp;
forced to perform complex rituals in order to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.440
ensure that the beast remains contained,&nbsp;
so it doesn’t escape and devour us all.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:36.560
But there’s one big problem: The rituals&nbsp;
don’t work, the Foundation only performs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:40.160
them to give their own employees a&nbsp;
false sense of security. Right now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.800
the Foundation doesn’t know how to keep the&nbsp;
Devourer reliably contained. What they do know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:50.000
is, his chains are expected to break&nbsp;
some time over the next 30 years...

